---
// Static figure. Styling comes from the ".fig" rules in src/styles/global.css.
---
<svg class="fig" viewBox="0 0 640 340" role="img" aria-labelledby="ts-title ts-desc">
  <title id="ts-title">Torque–speed envelope of a motor, with and without a gearbox</title>
  <desc id="ts-desc">The motor alone covers a low, wide region: modest torque up to high speed. After an N to 1 gearbox the region is N times taller and N times narrower. Each envelope has a lower continuous region and an upper peak region.</desc>
  <line class="grid" x1="70" y1="50" x2="600" y2="50" /><line class="grid" x1="70" y1="130" x2="600" y2="130" /><line class="grid" x1="70" y1="210" x2="600" y2="210" />
  <!-- geared -->
  <polygon class="soft3" points="70,290 70,185 220,185 240,290" />
  <polygon class="soft3" points="70,185 70,50 193,50 220,185" opacity="0.55" />
  <polyline class="c3" fill="none" stroke-width="2.2" points="70,50 193,50 240,290" />
  <line class="c3" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="5 4" x1="70" y1="185" x2="220" y2="185" />
  <!-- motor alone -->
  <polygon class="soft1" points="70,290 70,255 519,255 580,290" />
  <polygon class="soft1" points="70,255 70,210 440,210 519,255" opacity="0.55" />
  <polyline class="c1" fill="none" stroke-width="2.2" points="70,210 440,210 580,290" />
  <line class="c1" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="5 4" x1="70" y1="255" x2="519" y2="255" />
  <!-- axes -->
  <polyline class="axis" points="70,30 70,290 610,290" />
  <text x="22" y="165" transform="rotate(-90 22 165)" text-anchor="middle" class="t-muted">Torque at the output</text>
  <text x="330" y="326" text-anchor="middle" class="t-muted">Speed at the output</text>
  <!-- labels -->
  <text x="258" y="72" class="t-strong">After an N:1 gearbox</text>
  <text x="258" y="90" class="t-muted">N× the torque, 1/N the speed</text>
  <text x="452" y="186" class="t-strong">Motor alone</text>
  <text x="286" y="237" class="t-small">Peak — seconds, limited by heating</text>
  <text x="286" y="277" class="t-small">Continuous — sustainable indefinitely</text>
  <text x="258" y="108" class="t-small t-muted">dashed line: continuous limit</text>
  <text x="580" y="305" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">no-load speed</text>
</svg>
